---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Presupuesto"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Seguimiento personal</p><h1>Presupuesto</h1><p>Registra gastos reales en este dispositivo. Los datos no salen del navegador.</p></section><section class="section budget"><div class="budget-total"><span>Gastado</span><strong data-expense-total>0,00 €</strong><small>Gastos reales guardados localmente</small></div><form class="expense-form" data-expense-form><label>Concepto<input required name="title" maxlength="80"/></label><label>Importe<input required name="amount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label><label>Moneda<select name="currency"><option>EUR</option><option>MAD</option></select></label><label>Categoría<input name="category" value="Otros"/></label><button class="button">Añadir gasto</button></form><div class="export-actions"><button data-export>Exportar copia JSON</button><label>Importar copia<input data-import type="file" accept="application/json"/></label></div><div data-expense-list class="expense-list"></div></section></BaseLayout>
